{"unit_id":"JasperGuWP__dsh-project-memory#feature-1","repo":"JasperGuWP/dsh-project-memory","commit":"2925ebfca3cc31764c4cbffe8ef8beafe3660cc0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-memory 的功能「跨会话检索」：按关键词从项目记忆索引和正文中找出匹配片段，同时返回完整目录。通过 memory_load_context 工具触发，输入查询词，可选限制结果数。","source":"generated","evidence":["memory-plugin.js:519-525","memory-plugin.js:464-470"]}
{"unit_id":"JasperGuWP__dsh-project-memory#feature-2","repo":"JasperGuWP/dsh-project-memory","commit":"2925ebfca3cc31764c4cbffe8ef8beafe3660cc0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-memory 的功能「项目记忆写入」：将用户要求保留的项目知识写入 Markdown 正文，并更新索引行。通过 memory_upsert 工具触发，输入主题、摘要和内容，可选类别与文件名。","source":"generated","evidence":["memory-plugin.js:625-630","memory-plugin.js:464-470"]}
{"unit_id":"JasperGuWP__dsh-project-memory#feature-3","repo":"JasperGuWP/dsh-project-memory","commit":"2925ebfca3cc31764c4cbffe8ef8beafe3660cc0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-memory 的功能「任务结论沉淀」：把任务结果追加到固定的 reference.md，并刷新索引对应条目。通过 memory_finalize 工具触发，输入摘要和正文，可选标签。","source":"generated","evidence":["memory-plugin.js:708-713","memory-plugin.js:464-470"]}
{"unit_id":"JasperGuWP__dsh-project-memory#feature-4","repo":"JasperGuWP/dsh-project-memory","commit":"2925ebfca3cc31764c4cbffe8ef8beafe3660cc0","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-project-memory 的功能「遗忘项目记忆」：按 Markdown 文件名或主题关键词删除匹配的正文文件并清理索引行。通过 memory_forget 工具触发，输入目标；索引文件与固定参考文件受保护。","source":"generated","evidence":["memory-plugin.js:784-789","memory-plugin.js:464-470"]}
